\tag{fnip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{A nullcline meets the orbits at an equilibrium}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The [nullclines](fnip-0014) locate the [equilibria](fnip-0014).
The [phase portrait](fnip-0015) is the partition into
[orbits](fnip-0015).}

\p{For the Morris–Lecar velocity of \ref{fnip-0005}, the second
component vanishes on the graph #{n=n_{\infty}(V)}.
\ref{fnip-0025} differentiates that graph in the Hopf column.}
